#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:475
#: 104471b9f1f24085a0557bc38f489c84
msgid "Disabling the Pre-arm Safety Check"
msgstr "禁用解锁前安全检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:477
#: 576fa958130f4bc38732f66214c60b2d
msgid ""
"Disabling pre-arm safety checks is not recommended. The cause of the pre-arm"
" failure should be corrected before operation of the vehicle if at all "
"possible. If you are confident that the pre-arm check failure is not a real "
"problem, it is possible to disable a failing check."
msgstr "不建议禁用解锁前安全检查。如果可能，应在飞行前纠正导致检查失败的原因。如果您确信某项检查失败并不是真正的问题，可以禁用该项检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:479
#: 65aae796c3104c88883b7460ff485e1a
msgid ""
"Arming checks can be individually disabled by setting the "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` parameter to something other than 1. "
"Setting to 0 completely removes all pre-arm checks. For example, setting to"
"  4 only checks that the GPS has lock."
msgstr ""
"可以通过将 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` 参数设置为非 1 的值来单独禁用各项解锁检查。设为 0 "
"则完全取消所有解锁前检查。例如，设为 4 则只检查 GPS 是否已锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:481
#: 30d5f4897f71474bbfc5974254c4852f
