msgstr "进入 Mission Planner 的 Config/Tuning >> Standard Params 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-prearm-safety-checks.rst:489
#: 8f2554b184034d11927575a543380b73
msgid ""
"set the Arming Check drop-down to \"Disabled\" or one of the \"Skip\" "
"options which more effectively skips the item causing the failure."
msgstr "将解锁检查（Arming Check）下拉菜单设置为 'Disabled' 或某个 'Skip' 选项，以更有效地跳过导致失败的项目。"

